<a href="#jak-wyglada" class="btn-ghost" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:700;color:#16211a;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);padding:18px 26px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(22,33,26,0.16)">Zobacz, jak to wygląda →</a>
